%% F4.5 Push transfer (HttpData-PUSH) in stock EDC 0.14.1, one message; no measured values
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant APP as Consumer application
  participant CCP as Consumer CP
  participant PCP as Provider CP
  participant PDP as Provider DP
  participant SRC as Data source
  participant RCV as Data receiver
  Note over APP,PCP: Once per contract
  APP->>CCP: catalogue request
  CCP->>PCP: DSP catalogue request
  PCP-->>CCP: catalogue (offers)
  APP->>CCP: negotiate offer
  CCP->>PCP: DSP contract negotiation
  PCP-->>CCP: contract agreement
  Note over APP,RCV: Once per message
  APP->>CCP: transfer request (HttpData-PUSH, destination = receiver)
  CCP->>PCP: DSP transfer request
  PCP->>PDP: data plane signalling: start
  PDP->>SRC: GET data
  SRC-->>PDP: payload
  PDP->>RCV: POST payload
  PDP-->>PCP: transfer completed
  PCP-->>CCP: DSP transfer completion
